@startuml
title Field Web Client — Planned Capability Design
skinparam packageStyle folder
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam packageBackgroundColor White
skinparam packageBorderColor #5D6D7E
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #5D6D7E
skinparam ArrowColor #44566A
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 65
skinparam linetype polyline
' Hidden arrows below are layout constraints only, never dependencies.
package "Target in mobile-friendly apps/web; apps/mobile is a placeholder" as Field #FFF2CC {
folder "Local capture store (planned)" as F0
folder "Stable operation identity" as F1
folder "Sync coordinator (planned)" as F2
folder "Reconciliation views (planned)" as F3
folder "Capture API / existing idempotency" as F4
folder "Receiving state integration" as F5
F0 .right.> F1
F1 .right.> F2
F3 -[hidden]right-> F4
F4 -[hidden]right-> F5
F0 -[hidden]down-> F3
F1 -[hidden]down-> F4
F2 -[hidden]down-> F5
}
legend bottom
APPLIED procurement source registration is distinct from accepted actual arrival and usable stock.
No native app or complete offline client is claimed implemented.
endlegend
@enduml
